"日本季度 GDP 速报","official_url":"https://www.esri.cao.go.jp/en/sna/kouhyou/kouhyou_top.html","scheduled_at":"2026-11-15T23:50:00Z","tier":1},"next_key_event":{"at":"2026-11-15T23:50:00Z","date_only":false,"economy":"jp","event_key":"jp-gdp:2026-11-16","name":"日本季度 GDP 速报","official_url":"https://www.esri.cao.go.jp/en/sna/kouhyou/kouhyou_top.html","scheduled_at":"2026-11-15T23:50:00Z","tier":1},"visible_event_keys":["jp-gdp:2026-11-16","cn-activity:2026-11-16","ca-cpi:2026-11-16","au-rba-minutes:2026-11-17","uk-labour-market:2026-11-17","us-retail-sales:2026-11-17"]},"policy_divergence":{"cuts":[],"hikes":["boe","boc","rba","riksbank"],"holds":["fed","ecb","boj","snb","norges"],"unknown":["pboc"],"window_days":90},"rate_pulse":{"bank":"boe","change_bp":25,"cuts":[],"date":"2026-11-05","hikes":["boe","boc","rba","riksbank"],"holds":["fed","ecb","boj","snb","norges"],"rate":"4.00%","url":"https://www.bankofengland.co.uk/monetary-policy-summary-and-minutes/2026/november-2026"}},"review_by":"2026-12-08","sources":[{"label":"加拿大央行 10-28","url":"https://www.bankofcanada.ca/2026/10/fad-press-release-2026-10-28/"},{"label":"澳洲联储 11-03","url":"https://www.rba.gov.au/media-releases/2026/mr-26-30.html"},{"label":"瑞典央行 11-04","url":"https://www.riksbank.se/en-gb/press-and-published/notices-and-press-releases/press-releases/2026/policy-rate-raised-to-2-per-cent/"},{"label":"英国央行 11-05","url":"https://www.bankofengland.co.uk/monetary-policy-summary-and-minutes/2026/november-2026"},{"label":"美国 10 月 CPI","url":"https://www.bls.gov/news.release/archives/cpi_11102026.htm"}]},"schema_version":2,"statement_highlights":{"banks":[{"attribution":"英国央行原文，经节选","bank":"boe","checked_at":"2026-11-14T06:00:00Z","decision":"上调 25 个基点至 4.00%","detail":"投票比 8–1，1 名委员主张直接加息 50bp 至 4.25%（上次为 6–3 维持）；会前英国央行市场参与者调查的中位数预期即为 4.00%。","detail_url":"https://www.bankofengland.co.uk/monetary-policy-summary-and-minutes/2026/november-2026","highlights":[{"new_en":"The Committee will adjust Bank Rate as necessary to ensure CPI inflation returns to the 2% target in the medium term.","old_en":"The Committee stands ready to act as necessary to ensure that CPI inflation remains on track to meet the 2% target in the medium term.","spans":[{"kind":"equal","text":"The Committee"},{"kind":"removed","text":"stands ready to act"},{"kind":"added","text":"will adjust Bank Rate"},{"kind":"equal","text":"as necessary to ensure"},{"kind":"removed","text":"that"},{"kind":"equal","text":"CPI inflation"},{"kind":"removed","text":"remains on track"},{"kind":"added","text":"returns"},{"kind":"equal","text":"to"},{"kind":"removed","text":"meet"},{"kind":"equal","text":"the 2% target in the medium term."}],"subtext":"“随时准备行动”升级为“将按需调整利率”，“保持在目标路径”改为“回到目标”，等于承认通胀偏离；后续每次会议都可能再动。","zh":"委员会将视需要调整 Bank Rate，确保 CPI 通胀在中期回到 2% 的目标。"},{"new_en":"However, the degree of inflationary pressure in the pipeline is now sufficient to warrant an increase in Bank Rate.","old_en":"However, the risk of such effects, against which policy needs to lean, is greater the longer higher energy prices persist or are more volatile.","spans":[{"kind":"equal","text":"However, the"},{"kind":"removed","text":"risk of such effects, against which policy needs to lean, is greater the longer higher energy prices persist or are more volatile."},{"kind":"added","text":"degree of inflationary pressure in the pipeline is now sufficient to warrant an increase in Bank Rate."}],"subtext":"上次只说风险越拖越大、政策需要顶住；这次直接认定在途的通胀压力“已足以”支持加息。从警告到行动，鹰派转向写进了正文。","zh":"不过，正在传导中的通胀压力，其程度现已足以支持上调 Bank Rate。"}],"name":"英国央行","new_date":"2026-11-05","old_date":"2026-09-17","old_source_url":"https://www.bankofengland.co.uk/monetary-policy-summary-and-minutes/2026/september-2026","page_url":null,"source_url":"https://www.bankofengland.co.uk/monetary-policy-summary-and-minutes/2026/november-2026"},{"attribution":"美联储声明原文","bank":"fed","checked_at":"2026-11-14T06:00:00Z","decision":"维持 3.75%–4.00%","detail":"投票比 10–2，库克与哈马克主张本次再加息 25bp（9 月 16 日刚加息 25bp）。","detail_url":"https://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/pressreleases/monetary20261028a.htm","highlights":[{"new_en":"The accumulation of more information will help the Committee determine the policy stance appropriate to ensure a timely return of inflation to the Committee's 2 percent goal.","old_en":"Today's policy action will support a timelier return to the Committee's 2 percent goal.","spans":[{"kind":"removed","text":"Today's policy action will support a timelier return"},{"kind":"added","text":"The accumulation of more information will help the Committee determine the policy stance appropriate to ensure a timely return of inflation"},{"kind":"equal","text":"to the Committee's 2 percent goal."}],"subtext":"从“本次行动”改为“积累更多信息”，是暂停的信号，但并未承诺停止加息；12 月是否再动，看届时的通胀与就业数据。","zh":"更多信息的积累将帮助委员会确定合适的政策立场，以确保通胀及时回到委员会 2% 的目标。"},{"new_en":"Economic activity is expanding at a strong pace.","old_en":"Economic activity is expanding at a solid pace.","spans":[{"kind":"equal","text":"Economic activity is expanding at a"},{"kind":"removed","text":"solid"},{"kind":"added","text":"strong"},{"kind":"equal","text":"pace."}],"subtext":"对经济的评价由“稳健”上调为“强劲”，说明暂停不是因为增长转弱；这只是增长评估一处用词的变化，偏鹰但分量有限。","zh":"经济活动正以强劲的步伐扩张。"}],"name":"美联储","new_date":"2026-10-28","old_date":"2026-09-16","old_source_url":"https://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/pressreleases/monetary20260916a.htm","page_url":"https://heronatlas.com/central-banks/fed/2026-10-28/","source_url":"https://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/pressreleases/monetary20261028a.htm"},{"attribution":"来源：澳洲联储 2026，经节选（CC BY 4.0）","bank":"rba","checked_at":"2026-11-14T06:00:00Z","decision":"上调 25 个基点至 4.85%","detail":"投票比 6–3，3 名委员主张维持 4.60%（9 月 29 日的加息决定为一致同意）。","detail_url":"https://www.rba.gov.au/media-releases/2026/mr-26-30.html","highlights":[{"new_en":"The Board will continue to do what it considers necessary to bring inflation sustainably back to target.","old_en":"The Board will continue to do what it considers necessary to bring inflation sustainably back to target, including increasing the cash rate target further if needed.","spans":[{"kind":"equal","text":"The Board will continue to do what it considers necessary to bring inflation sustainably back to"},{"kind":"removed","text":"target, including increasing the cash rate target further if needed."},{"kind":"added","text":"target."}],"subtext":"加息的同时删掉了“必要时进一步上调现金利率”这半句，再加上 3 票主张不动，说明委员会对继续加息的共识在减弱，措辞偏鸽。","zh":"委员会将继续采取其认为必要的措施，使通胀可持续地回到目标。"},{"new_en":"Inflation is now expected to remain above 3 per cent for the coming year and there is an increasing risk that higher inflation expectations will become embedded.","old_en":"The Board remains focused on ensuring that high inflation does not become embedded.","spans":[{"kind":"removed","text":"The Board remains focused on ensuring that high inflation does not"},{"kind":"added","text":"Inflation is now expected to remain above 3 per cent for the coming year and there is an increasing risk that higher inflation expectations will"},{"kind":"equal","text":"become embedded."}],"subtext":"对通胀的判断却更重：未来一年通胀料高于 3%，预期固化的风险在上升。删掉加息承诺不等于收手，后续会议仍看数据。","zh":"目前预计未来一年通胀将保持在 3% 以上，较高的通胀预期变得根深蒂固的风险正在上升。"}],"name":"澳洲联储","new_date":"2026-11-03","old_date":"2026-09-29","old_source_url":"https://www.rba.gov.au/media-releases/2026/mr-26-27.html","page_url":null,"source_url":"https://www.rba.gov.au/media-releases/2026/mr-26-30.html"},{"attribution":"欧洲央行原文，经节选","bank":"ecb","checked_at":"2026-11-14T06:00:00Z","decision":"三项关键利率维持不变（存款便利利率 2.50%）","detail":"9 月 10 日加息 25bp 后本次按兵不动；声明未披露投票情况。","detail_url":"https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/pr/date/2026/html/ecb.mp261029~9a493adf17.en.html","highlights":[{"new_en":null,"old_en":"The conflict in the Middle East continues to generate inflation pressures, and inflation is set to remain well above target for an extended period.","spans":[{"kind":"removed","text":"The conflict in the Middle East continues to generate inflation pressures, and inflation is set to remain well above target for an extended period."}],"subtext":"删去“通胀将长期远高于目标”的确定性判断，但新声明仍称能源冲击可能推高通胀：从下结论退回到提示风险，为按兵不动留出空间。","zh":"中东冲突继续带来通胀压力，通胀将在较长时间内保持在远高于目标的水平。"},{"new_en":"While the full effects of the energy shock are still unfolding, underlying inflation has remained broadly stable so far and wages do not show a material response at this stage.","old_en":null,"spans":[{"kind":"added","text":"While the full effects of the energy shock are still unfolding, underlying inflation has remained broadly stable so far and wages do not show a material response at this stage."}],"subtext":"新增“基础通胀到目前为止大体稳定、工资现阶段没有明显反应”，这是本次暂停的依据；两处限定语都留了余地，后续要看工资数据。","zh":"能源冲击的全部影响仍在显现，但到目前为止，基础通胀大体保持稳定，工资现阶段也没有明显反应。"}],"name":"欧洲央行","new_date":"2026-10-29","old_date":"2026-09-10","old_source_url":"https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/pr/date/2026/html/ecb.mp260910~314e508016.en.html","page_url":"https://heronatlas.com/central-banks/ecb/2026-10-29/","source_url":"https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/pr/date/2026/html/ecb.mp261029~9a493adf17.en.html"}],"default_bank":"boe"}}
